    "description": "Actionable error state without fake success or client-side retry.",
    "html": "\u003csection class=\"syn-root syn-region\" data-syn-theme=\"studio\" aria-labelledby=\"syn-error-heading\">\n  \u003cdiv class=\"syn-panel\">\n    \u003cp class=\"syn-eyebrow\">Unable to load / 503\u003c/p>\n    \u003ch2 id=\"syn-error-heading\" class=\"syn-heading\">This view is temporarily unavailable\u003c/h2>\n    \u003cp>No changes were submitted. Check service status or return to your dashboard.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"syn-inline\">\u003ca class=\"syn-button syn-button--primary\" href=\"/dashboard\">Return to dashboard\u003c/a>\u003ca class=\"syn-button\" href=\"/status\">Service status\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cp class=\"syn-help\">The server must return the correct HTTP error status and provide a working retry route if available.\u003c/p>\n  \u003c/div>\n\u003c/section>",
    "keywords": "Error recovery view Actionable error state without fake success or client-side retry. error recovery status",
