    "description": "A semantic comparison matrix that can scroll within narrow containers.",
    "html": "\u003csection class=\"syn-root syn-region\" data-syn-theme=\"studio\" aria-labelledby=\"syn-compare\">\n  \u003ch2 id=\"syn-compare\" class=\"syn-heading\">Compare plan capabilities\u003c/h2>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"syn-table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Plan capabilities; scroll horizontally to view all columns\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    \u003ctable class=\"syn-table\">\n      \u003ccaption>Illustrative package feature comparison\u003c/caption>\n      \u003cthead>\u003ctr>\u003cth scope=\"col\">Capability\u003c/th>\u003cth scope=\"col\">Basic\u003c/th>\u003cth scope=\"col\">Team\u003c/th>\u003c/tr>\u003c/thead>\n      \u003ctbody>\n        \u003ctr>\u003cth scope=\"row\">Shared projects\u003c/th>\u003ctd>3\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Unlimited\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\n        \u003ctr>\u003cth scope=\"row\">Email support\u003c/th>\u003ctd>Included\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Included\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\n        \u003ctr>\u003cth scope=\"row\">Team permissions\u003c/th>\u003ctd>Not included\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Included\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\n      \u003c/tbody>\n    \u003c/table>\n  \u003c/div>\n  \u003cp class=\"syn-caption\">Replace sample capabilities with real product entitlements.\u003c/p>\n\u003c/section>",
