    "id": "block-scrollable-card-rail",
    "title": "Scrollable product card rail",
    "module": "syntyr.core.css + syntyr.recipes.css",
    "description": "An accessible, CSS-only horizontal collection for feature, portfolio or editorial cards.",
    "html": "\u003csection class=\"syn-root syn-region\" data-syn-theme=\"studio\" aria-labelledby=\"syn-scroll-collection-title\">\n  \u003cheader class=\"syn-page-header\">\n    \u003cdiv>\u003cp class=\"syn-eyebrow\">EXPLORE THE PLATFORM\u003c/p>\u003ch2 id=\"syn-scroll-collection-title\" class=\"syn-heading\">Built for the whole team\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cp class=\"syn-muted\">An overflow-friendly collection of independent cards. Scroll sideways for more.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\n    \u003ca class=\"syn-button syn-button--outline\" href=\"/features\">All features\u003c/a>\n  \u003c/header>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"syn-scroll-rail\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Product highlights, scroll horizontally for additional cards\">\n    \u003carticle class=\"syn-evidence-card\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-media syn-evidence-media--placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01 / REPORTS\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-body\">\u003ch3>Reports without friction\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Give your team a shared view of the latest numbers.\u003c/p>\n        \u003ca href=\"/features/reports\">Explore reporting\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/article>\n    \u003carticle class=\"syn-evidence-card\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-media syn-evidence-media--placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02 / WORKFLOWS\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-body\">\u003ch3>Work moves forward\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Track owners, due dates, approvals and handoffs.\u003c/p>\n        \u003ca href=\"/features/workflows\">Explore workflows\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/article>\n    \u003carticle class=\"syn-evidence-card\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-media syn-evidence-media--placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03 / CONNECT\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-body\">\u003ch3>Connect your tools\u003c/h3>\u003cp>Bring key records together without switching tabs.\u003c/p>\n        \u003ca href=\"/features/integrations\">Explore integrations\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/article>\n    \u003carticle class=\"syn-evidence-card\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-media syn-evidence-media--placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04 / CONTROL\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"syn-evidence-body\">\u003ch3>Stay in control\u003c/h3>\u003cp>See permission scopes and operational history.\u003c/p>\n        \u003ca href=\"/features/security\">Explore security\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/article>\n  \u003c/div>\n\u003c/section>",
